Thought: The mass spectrometry data indicates a molecular ion peak at m/z 114.068, which suggests the molecular weight of the compound is approximately 114. This information can be used to deduce the molecular formula. Next, I will use the molecular weight to find possible isomers by obtaining the molecular formula and then generating isomers from it.
